# AEO

Sydra is software, not a clinic. Keep `Organization` + `SoftwareApplication`. Do not emit `MedicalOrganization` or `MedicalBusiness` for Sydra. Physician `reviewedBy` (Dr. Abrahams `@id`) carries medical E-E-A-T.

## Entity graph
- Organization and WebSite emit once in the root layout with stable `@id`s (`/#organization`, `/#website`).
- Educational pages use `drAbrahamsPersonJsonLd()` (`/about#dr-abrahams`). Never mint a second Person node without that `@id`.
- Article `author` is the physician `@id`. Organization stays `publisher`.
- Do not invent `sameAs` URLs. Org: `NEXT_PUBLIC_ORG_SAME_AS` or LinkedIn default. Physician: `NEXT_PUBLIC_PHYSICIAN_SAME_AS` only.

## FAQ
Visible questions must match `FAQPage` JSON-LD 1:1 from the same constant. Render each question as `h2` or `h3`, not only a `<summary>` string.

## Markdown twins
Citation pages need a twin at the same path with `.md` (`/` → `/index.md`), generated from the same content module as the HTML. Advertise with `Link: rel=alternate; type=text/markdown` and `rel=describedby` → `/llms.txt`. `llms.txt` links to markdown URLs. Skip deep CPT and payer permutations.

## Crawlers
Keep GPTBot, OAI-SearchBot, ChatGPT-User, ClaudeBot, Claude-SearchBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, and the rest of the allowlist in `robots.ts`. Do not block AI crawlers on public pages.

## Copy
Answer-first: 40–60 word definition immediately after H1 on definitional pages. Do not rewrite legally frozen homepage H1 copy in `src/lib/content/homepage.ts`.
